---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
const UPDATED = 'July 8, 2026'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms and Conditions for using LimasawaBooking.com — the accommodation and rental directory for Limasawa Island, Southern Leyte, Philippines."
>
  <main class="legal-wrap">
    <header class="legal-head">
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>
    </header>

    <article class="legal-body">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          LimasawaBooking.com ("<strong>Limasawa Booking</strong>", "we", "us") is an online directory and
          listing platform for accommodations, vehicle rentals, and travel information on Limasawa Island,
          Southern Leyte, Philippines. By accessing or using the site you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions.
          If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. We are a directory, not a party to bookings</h2>
        <p>
          Limasawa Booking connects travellers ("<strong>guests</strong>") with accommodation owners and
          rental providers ("<strong>hosts</strong>"). <strong>All bookings, reservations, payments for stays or
          rentals, and any other transactions happen directly between the guest and the host.</strong> We do not
          process booking payments, hold deposits, or act as an agent, broker, or insurer for either party.
        </p>
        <p>
          Prices, availability, photos, and amenity details are provided by hosts (or compiled from public
          information for unclaimed listings) and may change without notice. Always confirm the final price
          and availability directly with the host before travelling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          You may browse without an account. Creating an account (as a guest or host) requires accurate
          information and a valid email address. You are responsible for keeping your login credentials
          confidential and for all activity under your account. We may suspend or terminate accounts that
          violate these terms, post fraudulent content, or misuse the platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Host listings</h2>
        <p>By publishing a listing you confirm that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>you own or are authorised to represent the property or rental business listed;</li>
          <li>all details (pricing, amenities, photos, location, contact numbers) are accurate and kept up to date;</li>
          <li>you hold any permits or registrations required to operate your business;</li>
          <li>photos you upload are yours or you have the right to use them.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Listings are reviewed before publication and we may edit, decline, pause, or remove a listing at
          our discretion. Listing claims (taking over an unclaimed listing) are verified manually and we may
          request proof of ownership.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Paid listing tiers</h2>
        <p>
          Hosts may purchase optional paid tiers (e.g. Pro, Verified, or Featured) that improve listing
          visibility. Tier payments are made via the e-wallet or bank details shown at checkout and are
          verified manually before the tier is activated. Tier fees are for platform placement only — they are
          not commissions on bookings. Except where required by law, tier payments are non-refundable once
          the tier has been activated. Tiers expire at the end of the paid period and downgrade automatically
          unless renewed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Reviews and content</h2>
        <p>
          Reviews must reflect a genuine experience and must not contain unlawful, defamatory, or abusive
          content. Hosts moderate reviews on their own listings; we may additionally remove content that
          violates these terms. By posting content (reviews, photos, blog posts) you grant us a non-exclusive
          licence to display it on the platform. You keep ownership of your content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>scrape, harvest, or bulk-download listing or contact data;</li>
          <li>post false listings, fake reviews, or impersonate another person or business;</li>
          <li>use the platform to send spam or unsolicited marketing;</li>
          <li>interfere with the operation or security of the site.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided "as is" and "as available". We make no warranty that listing information is
          accurate or complete, that any host will honour a booking, or that the site will be uninterrupted or
          error-free. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Limasawa Booking is not liable for any loss or
          damage arising from your dealings with hosts or guests, from reliance on listing content, or from
          use of the site — including travel costs, personal injury, or property damage connected with a stay
          or rental. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under Philippine law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the Philippines. Any dispute shall be
          brought before the competent courts of Southern Leyte, Philippines.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Changes and contact</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time; the "Last updated" date above reflects the current
          version. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Questions? Contact us at {/* email_off: Cloudflare rewrites bare mailto: to a 404ing /cdn-cgi path — see SiteFooter.astro */}
          <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:nico@podiumapps.com">nico@podiumapps.com</a><!--/email_off-->.
          See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
